            {
              "id": "gid://gitlab/Discussion/03821bc4d0ebdb933033c2ffd2bd01d071beed79",
              "resolvable": false,
              "resolved": false,
              "notes": {
                "pageInfo": {
                  "hasNextPage": false
                },
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "id": "gid://gitlab/Note/4101668255",
                    "body": "I reviewed the changes since my last review and found no new issues. Previous findings:\n\n- **Fixed:** `internal/commands/govern/setup/setup.go`: runSetup and runUninstall now call claudehooks.CheckConfigDir() first, before installFallbackSync or any other work, so a relative CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR is rejected before it is ever written into the job; new tests confirm nothing is written in that case.\n- **Still outstanding:** `internal/commands/govern/internal/fallbacksync/fallbacksync.go`: readJob still checks only the fixed ~/.config/systemd/user path and returns ErrNotInstalled before systemdServiceFiles' full priority-directory search runs; this code is unchanged in this revision.",
